<title>GREECE: Greek 1M ATHIBOR drops to 13.13pct from 13.21pct.</title>
<headline>Greek 1M ATHIBOR drops to 13.13pct from 13.21pct.</headline>
<text>
<p>ATHENS, Sept 20 Reuter) - The Athens Interbank Offered Rate (Athibor) for one month fell to 13.13 from 13.21 percent on Wednesday and the bid rate (Athibid) decreased to 12.64 from 12.73 percent.</p>
